```latex
\documentclass{article}
\usepackage{media}

\begin{document}

\media[src=summer_day.wav]{
    \audio[controls=true]{summer\_day.wav}
}

\end{document}
```
This will include an audio player in your LaTeX document that allows you to listen to the summer day audio file. You can also use the `media` package to include other media types such as images and videos.

